            "review_title": "Review at Shabu Shō Japanese Hotpot",
            "review_text": "Thu Tran\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nbest shabu in hanoi!\nJan 2026 • Business\nthey serve authentic shabu with ersonal pot for each person – kinda rare in Hanoi. feels comfy and private.\n\nbeef was soooo good. we had kamichiku wagyu and kobe striploin, and one more but i forgot the name. super tender and it melts right in your mouth.\n\nthe restaurant is spacious, zen, calm, and cozy\n\ncame here with my colleagues and we all love it. im thinking about taking my parents here next time.\n\ntips: try the swish swish tips on the table (whisper shabu-shabu twice for the perfect donesness of beef). also, try make porridge or udon bowl with leftover broth. super umami!\nRead more\nWritten February 27, 2026",
